  "prefLabel": "Lab 502.14 Special Officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 502.14 “Special Officer” means a person employed as a law enforcement officer by any political subdivision of the state for a temporary or specific purpose, or who was duly appointed by the appointing authority and works part-time.\n\nSource. #11067, eff 4-1-16",
